WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:02:24.489
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
02:24.759 --> 02:25.319
All done.

3
02:25.719 --> 02:26.400
You can move now.

4
02:26.840 --> 02:27.719
You can move now.

5
02:34.120 --> 02:35.599
You drew this so well.

6
02:46.199 --> 02:48.120
I want to name this piece.

7
02:50.039 --> 02:51.039
What do you want to call it?

8
02:52.719 --> 02:53.319
Angel.

9
02:54.639 --> 02:55.840
What's that supposed to mean?

10
02:59.000 --> 02:59.719
Angel.

11
03:07.319 --> 03:07.919
Do you like it?

12
03:10.759 --> 03:11.960
You're really bold.

13
03:13.039 --> 03:14.919
Didn't the brewery call for new beer labels?

14
03:15.080 --> 03:16.159
So I submitted a design.

15
03:16.680 --> 03:18.080
Never expected it'd actually get picked.

16
03:18.560 --> 03:19.919
I sent it in anonymously.

17
03:20.520 --> 03:21.960
No one knows I drew it.

18
03:22.520 --> 03:24.319
And no one knows it's you.

19
03:29.840 --> 03:31.039
Don't come around here anymore.

20
03:31.719 --> 03:32.680
During work hours,

21
03:32.800 --> 03:33.919
outsiders aren't allowed in the workshop.

22
03:34.360 --> 03:34.960
Now get going.

23
03:50.800 --> 03:51.360
Let me ask you something.

24
03:51.479 --> 03:51.960
What's this?

25
03:54.439 --> 03:55.360
Nothing.

26
03:55.759 --> 03:57.000
Just doodling.

27
03:57.199 --> 03:58.080
Doodling?

28
03:58.080 --> 03:58.800
Who did you draw?

29
04:00.240 --> 04:01.319
None of your business.

30
04:02.639 --> 04:03.319
Tell me.

31
04:03.360 --> 04:04.080
Who did you draw?

32
04:04.800 --> 04:05.360
Answer me!

33
04:06.479 --> 04:07.159
What are you doing?

34
04:07.199 --> 04:07.879
Sit down!

35
04:10.080 --> 04:11.479
Did you draw Liu Xuemei?

36
04:12.599 --> 04:13.360
You think I'm blind?

37
04:13.360 --> 04:14.199
Like I can't tell?

38
04:17.279 --> 04:19.279
Are you seeing her?

39
04:25.160 --> 04:25.800
Fine.

40
04:26.240 --> 04:26.759
Fine.

41
04:27.519 --> 04:28.639
I'm not gonna argue with you.

42
04:29.519 --> 04:30.959
Let's talk this through calmly.

43
04:33.759 --> 04:34.439
I'm your father.

44
04:34.439 --> 04:34.959
Right?

45
04:35.560 --> 04:36.800
I wouldn't steer you wrong, would I?

46
04:38.120 --> 04:39.879
At your age,

47
04:40.319 --> 04:41.399
dating someone

48
04:41.560 --> 04:42.480
is completely normal.

49
04:43.360 --> 04:44.480
But whoever you're with,

50
04:44.480 --> 04:46.600
it can't be a divorced woman in her thirties

51
04:46.639 --> 04:49.160
who already has a kid!

52
04:51.040 --> 04:51.959
This Liu Xuemei...

53
04:52.079 --> 04:53.519
What... what does she even do?

54
04:53.759 --> 04:55.160
A Beer Taster.

55
04:55.240 --> 04:56.360
And what about you?

56
04:56.639 --> 04:58.759
A college graduate!

57
04:58.879 --> 05:01.160
How did you get mixed up with her?

58
05:01.519 --> 05:02.600
You like her?

59
05:03.800 --> 05:04.839
What's so great about her?

60
05:05.319 --> 05:06.839
So what if I like her?

61
05:07.000 --> 05:07.920
Say that again!

62
05:07.959 --> 05:09.160
What century are we in?

63
05:09.600 --> 05:10.959
You even want to police my love life?

64
05:12.439 --> 05:13.439
You're so annoying!

65
05:15.120 --> 05:16.120
Get back here!

66
05:25.480 --> 05:26.279
Xuemei!

67
05:41.120 --> 05:41.800
Chen Yuan.

68
05:43.720 --> 05:45.480
We shouldn't see each other anymore.

69
05:46.480 --> 05:47.160
Why?

70
05:50.360 --> 05:51.800
Chief Engineer Chen has known for a while.

71
05:52.480 --> 05:53.480
I could tell.

72
05:54.120 --> 05:55.519
Your dad is an educated man.

73
05:55.600 --> 05:56.480
He cares about his dignity.

74
05:57.160 --> 05:57.839
Something like this...

75
05:58.399 --> 05:59.759
he could never tell anyone.

76
06:00.360 --> 06:01.759
He's him, and I'm me.

77
06:02.560 --> 06:03.680
I don't care what he thinks.

78
06:04.120 --> 06:05.399
Don't talk out of spite.

79
06:06.600 --> 06:07.920
You two are family.

80
06:08.560 --> 06:09.600
He wouldn't steer you wrong.

81
06:10.720 --> 06:11.800
You should listen to him.

82
06:13.160 --> 06:14.040
Xuemei.

83
06:14.360 --> 06:15.839
I don't want to break up with you.

84
06:24.000 --> 06:24.800
Listen to me.

85
06:25.920 --> 06:27.199
Go home and get a good night's sleep.

86
06:27.720 --> 06:28.839
Just treat our time together...

87
06:29.360 --> 06:30.279
as a dream.

88
06:34.199 --> 06:34.839
Goodbye.

89
06:36.519 --> 06:37.399
Xuemei, don't go!

90
06:38.000 --> 06:39.319
I really can't live without you.

91
06:39.720 --> 06:41.560
I want to be with you for the rest of my life, Xuemei.

92
06:42.399 --> 06:43.120
Please.

93
06:43.480 --> 06:44.639
Don't give up on me, okay?

94
06:48.040 --> 06:49.279
This is my dorm's number.

95
06:50.360 --> 06:51.279
You'll call me,

96
06:52.439 --> 06:53.040
right?

97
07:08.040 --> 07:08.800
Chen Yuan.

98
07:09.079 --> 07:10.040
Phone for you.

99
07:13.639 --> 07:14.279
Xuemei.

100
07:14.720 --> 07:15.600
How've you been lately?

101
07:16.439 --> 07:17.279
I'm doing great.

102
07:21.199 --> 07:22.879
Just that I can't see you.

103
07:23.319 --> 07:24.319
I miss you so much.

104
07:25.519 --> 07:26.560
I'm in Qingzhou.

105
07:28.439 --> 07:29.000
Really?

106
07:29.120 --> 07:29.839
Meet at the usual spot.

107
07:29.879 --> 07:30.519
Wait for me.

108
07:30.879 --> 07:31.360
Wait for me, okay?

109
07:32.600 --> 07:33.279
Thank you, Auntie.

110
07:49.519 --> 07:50.160
Xuemei.

111
07:55.639 --> 07:56.480
You must be cold.

112
08:38.679 --> 08:39.720
Hurry up and go.

113
08:44.480 --> 08:45.240
Auntie,

114
08:45.279 --> 08:46.720
did anyone call Chen Yuan?

115
08:46.759 --> 08:47.320
Yeah.

116
08:47.919 --> 08:48.840
They called quite a few times.

117
08:48.840 --> 08:49.480
When?

118
08:49.559 --> 08:50.519
About an hour ago.

119
08:51.759 --> 08:52.279
The phone.

120
08:57.840 --> 08:58.840
Your hands are freezing.

121
10:03.399 --> 10:04.879
Come on,

122
10:04.879 --> 10:07.039
I'll take you out for hot pot.

123
10:07.320 --> 10:09.320
We'll celebrate the new millennium together.

124
10:09.480 --> 10:11.320
Happy New Year!

125
10:11.360 --> 10:13.240
Happy New Year!

126
10:13.279 --> 10:15.240
Of course I want to go with you,

127
10:15.399 --> 10:16.840
but I promised my coworkers

128
10:17.039 --> 10:18.120
I'd go to the auction with them.

129
10:18.799 --> 10:20.440
But tonight is Millennium Eve!

130
10:20.799 --> 10:22.320
It only happens once every thousand years.

131
10:23.519 --> 10:24.200
Over there,

132
10:24.919 --> 10:25.919
they have so many people.

133
10:26.519 --> 10:27.720
Here, I only have you.

134
10:28.679 --> 10:29.720
After today,

135
10:30.000 --> 10:31.720
the brewery will belong to all of us.

136
10:32.360 --> 10:33.720
This excitement...

137
10:34.039 --> 10:35.000
Can you feel it?

138
10:36.320 --> 10:38.080
I just want to be with you.

139
10:39.840 --> 10:41.559
All right, Mr. Chen.

140
10:41.879 --> 10:42.480
Be good.

141
10:42.799 --> 10:43.360
I promise you,

142
10:43.679 --> 10:45.720
I'll call you right on time tonight.

143
10:45.919 --> 10:47.679
We'll ring in the new year over the phone.

144
10:48.159 --> 10:48.639
Five,

145
10:49.159 --> 10:49.679
four,

146
10:50.000 --> 10:50.519
three,

147
10:51.039 --> 10:51.559
two,

148
10:51.879 --> 10:52.399
one.

149
10:52.559 --> 10:54.960
Happy New Year!

150
10:56.000 --> 10:56.360
All right.

151
10:56.399 --> 10:56.840
I'm running late.

152
10:56.840 --> 10:57.399
I've got to go.

153
11:00.399 --> 11:01.279
I'll be waiting!

154
11:03.159 --> 11:03.960
Midnight sharp!

155
11:07.240 --> 11:09.360
She must've been waiting for my call the whole time.

156
11:12.240 --> 11:14.799
We promised to ring in the millennium together,

157
11:16.679 --> 11:17.919
counting down together.

158
11:25.360 --> 11:26.080
I'm so sorry.

159
11:33.799 --> 11:35.639
So, according to your story,

160
11:35.639 --> 11:37.000
you stole the videotapes

161
11:37.000 --> 11:40.039
just to see Liu Xuemei again.

162
11:41.399 --> 11:42.080
Yes.

163
11:43.399 --> 11:45.240
Because Xuemei was a Beer Taster.

164
11:45.879 --> 11:48.159
The biggest taboo for a Beer Taster is drinking.

165
11:49.200 --> 11:50.960
To keep her palate sensitive,

166
11:51.159 --> 11:52.679
she never drank.

167
11:53.879 --> 11:55.720
So how could she have possibly drunk to excess?

168
11:57.559 --> 11:59.759
I found it suspicious right from the start.

169
12:00.759 --> 12:01.759
Only back then,

170
12:02.320 --> 12:03.480
I was afraid of everything,

171
12:05.480 --> 12:06.960
so I never dared to ask.

172
12:08.480 --> 12:10.320
So you believe Liu Xuemei

173
12:10.679 --> 12:11.600
died of unnatural causes?

174
12:12.080 --> 12:13.799
I don't believe she would drink that much.

175
12:14.879 --> 12:16.679
A woman who never touched a drop...

176
12:17.360 --> 12:19.200
How could she freeze to death while drunk?

177
12:21.879 --> 12:23.720
I don't believe she drank all that alcohol!

178
12:24.159 --> 12:24.879
It's impossible!

179
12:29.879 --> 12:31.279
Someone was trying to kill her.

180
12:35.879 --> 12:36.559
Weren't they?

181
12:47.399 --> 12:49.279
Do you know who the traitor was back then?

182
12:53.600 --> 12:54.600
All I know is

183
12:55.320 --> 12:57.120
they said Xuemei was the traitor.

184
13:00.240 --> 13:01.320
I don't believe that.

185
13:03.840 --> 13:04.759
As for anything else,

186
13:05.639 --> 13:06.440
I have no idea.

187
13:09.399 --> 13:10.600
Then can you tell us

188
13:10.679 --> 13:12.879
why you erased what was on the tape?

189
13:14.000 --> 13:15.840
It really was an accident.

190
13:16.480 --> 13:18.600
I already explained this to Shen Leshui.

191
13:19.080 --> 13:19.600
It's just that

192
13:19.600 --> 13:21.399
I hadn't used an old machine like that in so long.

193
13:22.559 --> 13:23.720
I can pay her for it.

194
13:25.799 --> 13:27.039
Do you have any recollection

195
13:27.480 --> 13:29.480
of what the content you erased

196
13:30.120 --> 13:31.120
actually was?

197
13:34.879 --> 13:35.960
I don't know.

198
13:48.120 --> 13:48.960
How did it go?

199
13:49.440 --> 13:50.279
For all three murders,

200
13:50.279 --> 13:51.639
he has alibis.

201
13:55.960 --> 13:57.399
Then why did he erase my tapes?

202
13:58.039 --> 13:59.320
He said it was an accident.

203
13:59.840 --> 14:02.360
Besides, there's no evidence it was deliberate.

204
14:03.120 --> 14:05.840
It was purely out of guilt toward Liu Xuemei

205
14:06.039 --> 14:07.320
that he stole your tapes.

206
14:09.320 --> 14:10.639
He confessed everything.

207
14:11.679 --> 14:12.639
He was pretty cooperative.

208
14:12.720 --> 14:14.679
You must've done a lot of persuading.

209
14:14.840 --> 14:15.440
Thanks for your hard work.

210
14:18.840 --> 14:19.919
Here's the letter of forgiveness.

211
14:21.120 --> 14:22.200
I don't plan to press charges.

212
14:22.840 --> 14:23.879
After all,

213
14:24.519 --> 14:25.720
he's my friend's husband,

214
14:26.559 --> 14:27.440
Xiaohu's father.

215
14:33.960 --> 14:34.519
Then...

216
14:34.519 --> 14:35.879
the erased footage,

217
14:36.240 --> 14:37.360
can it be recovered?

218
14:42.799 --> 14:44.200
Let's check the tapes at your place later.

219
14:46.480 --> 14:47.000
Sure.

220
14:53.919 --> 14:54.879
Why did you

221
14:55.519 --> 14:56.919
steal Shen Leshui's tapes?

222
14:58.200 --> 14:59.559
It's because of Liu Xuemei, isn't it?

223
15:09.399 --> 15:11.440
I really see you in a whole new light.

224
15:15.639 --> 15:17.399
Turns out your lack of romance

225
15:19.679 --> 15:21.159
depends on the person.

226
15:26.039 --> 15:26.919
I'm sorry.

227
15:59.840 --> 16:01.440
When we first got married,

228
16:02.879 --> 16:04.000
I always felt

229
16:05.759 --> 16:06.799
your heart wasn't in it.

230
16:07.679 --> 16:08.720
But you were

231
16:09.919 --> 16:10.679
good to me,

232
16:12.559 --> 16:13.399
really sincere,

233
16:15.639 --> 16:16.519
and hardworking.

234
16:19.080 --> 16:20.120
Didn't you always say

235
16:21.200 --> 16:22.159
that's just life,

236
16:23.399 --> 16:24.120
that's how it is?

237
16:26.600 --> 16:27.440
So I thought

238
16:30.879 --> 16:32.600
we had our whole lives ahead of us,

239
16:36.480 --> 16:38.159
and things would only get better.

240
16:40.440 --> 16:41.399
But I never expected this.

241
16:47.159 --> 16:47.879
I'm sorry.

242
16:52.120 --> 16:53.480
I shouldn't have kept it from you.

243
16:57.159 --> 16:59.399
I just didn't want to reopen that wound.

244
17:03.519 --> 17:05.279
I wanted to take this secret

245
17:07.680 --> 17:08.799
to my grave.

246
17:11.119 --> 17:12.799
I just never thought that after all these years,

247
17:14.839 --> 17:17.119
it would be dragged back out.

248
17:23.079 --> 17:24.359
You sure know how to keep things bottled up,

249
17:25.839 --> 17:26.480
Chen Yuan.

250
17:34.160 --> 17:35.759
The house, the car...

251
17:37.079 --> 17:38.039
they're all in your name.

252
17:39.680 --> 17:40.319
If...

253
17:44.160 --> 17:45.400
if you want a divorce,

254
17:49.359 --> 17:50.680
I'll walk away with nothing.

255
18:09.000 --> 18:09.960
Xiaohu is still young.

256
18:12.119 --> 18:13.480
I don't want him to think

257
18:14.279 --> 18:15.880
his dad was this or that.

258
18:29.559 --> 18:31.000
We're going to my dad's for dinner next week.

259
18:32.559 --> 18:33.680
Go buy a couple bottles of liquor.

260
18:52.559 --> 18:54.759
I... I only have 500 yuan on me right now.

261
18:55.200 --> 18:55.799
Um...

262
18:56.160 --> 18:57.799
I'll... I'll give you

263
18:57.799 --> 18:58.319
this much for now,

264
18:58.599 --> 18:59.720
and go back to get the rest.

265
19:03.200 --> 19:04.440
Which tape was erased?

266
19:10.160 --> 19:10.799
This one.

267
19:18.200 --> 19:19.240
That was the day of the auction.

268
19:20.119 --> 19:22.039
Ma Guowen didn't want the workers at the auction,

269
19:22.599 --> 19:24.240
so he locked them inside the factory.

270
19:32.000 --> 19:33.160
Everything after this is gone, right?

271
19:33.599 --> 19:34.000
Yeah.

272
19:34.680 --> 19:36.839
If he erased the shots of Liu Xuemei,

273
19:36.880 --> 19:37.920
I could understand that.

274
19:38.400 --> 19:40.440
But she isn't on this tape.

275
19:41.720 --> 19:43.599
Besides, on the day of the auction,

276
19:43.759 --> 19:45.640
she was with him in Qingzhou.

277
19:45.640 --> 19:46.799
He knew that.

278
19:47.200 --> 19:48.559
There's a date on the tape, too.

279
19:49.519 --> 19:51.480
So why would he erase a tape

280
19:51.559 --> 19:53.279
that had nothing to do with him?

281
19:55.200 --> 19:56.519
I think

282
19:56.680 --> 19:58.160
Chen Yuan isn't that simple.

283
19:58.519 --> 19:59.680
He must be hiding something.

284
20:04.759 --> 20:06.559
This shot looks kind of familiar to me.

285
20:06.599 --> 20:07.480
Wasn't this in your

286
20:07.480 --> 20:08.480
final cut of Malt Kingdom?

287
20:08.480 --> 20:09.160
Did it appear? 'Go to the venue!'

288
20:09.640 --> 20:10.440
That's impossible.

289
20:10.960 --> 20:12.279
Back then, the TV station cut all

290
20:12.279 --> 20:14.880
the footage about buying the factory.

291
20:15.559 --> 20:16.160
Really?

292
20:18.799 --> 20:19.400
'Go to the venue!'

293
20:19.759 --> 20:20.359
'Go to the venue!'

294
20:22.640 --> 20:23.160
Wait a second.

295
20:35.319 --> 20:35.680
Hold it.

296
20:36.240 --> 20:36.880
Right in this corner.

297
20:39.640 --> 20:40.400
Isn't that the exact same?

298
20:40.480 --> 20:41.039
Right?

299
20:47.880 --> 20:49.759
They couldn't find good shots of smiling faces then,

300
20:50.279 --> 20:51.720
so they used this footage from the factory shutdown.

301
20:52.000 --> 20:53.240
Pretty slick editing.

302
20:53.559 --> 20:54.880
The audience was completely fooled.

303
20:55.160 --> 20:56.000
You can't tell at all

304
20:56.000 --> 20:57.559
how tense things actually were back then.

305
20:58.119 --> 21:00.440
Twisting the truth is really that simple.

306
21:01.359 --> 21:02.680
Different editing techniques,

307
21:02.759 --> 21:03.839
set to different music,

308
21:04.039 --> 21:04.920
to build an atmosphere,

309
21:05.160 --> 21:06.279
and the audience gets fooled.

310
21:09.279 --> 21:10.559
Just like on my video channel.

311
21:10.559 --> 21:11.200
Is that so?

312
21:14.680 --> 21:15.440
Sorry about that.

313
21:17.359 --> 21:18.039
Then I don't get it.

314
21:18.079 --> 21:20.039
Why did Chen Yuan want to erase this part?

315
21:34.599 --> 21:36.319
Is that Chen Qingchun in the distance?

316
21:36.680 --> 21:38.160
What's he holding in his hand?

317
21:43.079 --> 21:44.359
Looks like a key ring.

318
21:44.640 --> 21:46.400
That guy handed Chen Qingchun a key ring.

319
21:49.720 --> 21:50.720
That guy's from Security.

320
21:54.279 --> 21:55.440
That makes him Ma Guowen's man.

321
21:58.519 --> 22:01.559
So Chen Yuan didn't want anyone to know

322
22:02.079 --> 22:03.119
that back then, his father

323
22:03.119 --> 22:05.039
was already colluding with Ma Guowen.

324
22:46.440 --> 22:47.079
Whoa there!

325
22:47.079 --> 22:48.519
Easy, brother!

326
22:48.720 --> 22:49.559
Slow down, take it easy.

327
22:50.240 --> 22:50.599
Careful now.

328
22:52.319 --> 22:52.799
Take it easy.

329
22:52.799 --> 22:53.799
Almost took a tumble there.

330
22:54.039 --> 22:54.640
You okay?

331
22:55.000 --> 22:56.079
Have a seat right here. Okay.

332
22:56.079 --> 22:56.640
Alright, alright, thanks.

333
22:57.039 --> 22:57.960
I'll set this over there for you.

334
22:57.960 --> 22:58.519
I got it, I got it.

335
22:58.839 --> 22:59.480
You're a good kid.

336
22:59.480 --> 23:00.039
Waitress!

337
23:01.519 --> 23:02.359
Anyone else,

338
23:02.759 --> 23:03.599
they wouldn't even bother helping me.

339
23:03.720 --> 23:04.759
They'd think it's a scam.

340
23:06.799 --> 23:07.519
Tomato rice bowl.

341
23:07.720 --> 23:08.079
Alright.

342
23:08.119 --> 23:09.480
Get me one of those too,

343
23:10.759 --> 23:12.119
and bring two sodas.

344
23:12.200 --> 23:12.920
Coming right up!

345
23:18.319 --> 23:19.200
You look pretty young.

346
23:19.240 --> 23:20.240
Just graduated from college?

347
23:20.839 --> 23:21.359
Just graduated.

348
23:21.759 --> 23:22.799
They're that big?

349
23:22.920 --> 23:23.920
Just one bottle is fine.

350
23:25.119 --> 23:25.680
Thank you, sir.

351
23:28.799 --> 23:30.599
Here, have a glass too.

352
23:31.200 --> 23:31.440
Sure.

353
23:31.480 --> 23:32.240
No worries, no worries.

354
23:32.720 --> 23:33.359
Have some.

355
23:34.119 --> 23:34.640
Thanks, brother.

356
23:34.640 --> 23:35.000
Don't mention it.

357
23:35.519 --> 23:36.039
Drink up.

358
23:36.400 --> 23:36.960
Quenches the thirst.

359
23:39.160 --> 23:40.039
Where do you work?

360
23:40.960 --> 23:42.200
Right next door at the service branch.

361
23:44.240 --> 23:45.559
Must make good money there.

362
23:45.960 --> 23:46.759
Just base pay, really.

363
23:47.160 --> 23:47.920
Barely enough to get by.

364
23:48.480 --> 23:49.440
We mostly rely on commission.

365
23:52.200 --> 23:52.799
Thank you.

366
23:53.960 --> 23:54.359
Thanks.

367
23:55.000 --> 23:55.640
Thanks, thank you.

368
23:56.319 --> 23:57.359
You're eating pretty light, huh?

369
23:57.880 --> 23:58.240
Well...

370
23:58.359 --> 23:58.799
It's cheap.

371
23:59.000 --> 23:59.480
And it tastes good.

372
23:59.880 --> 24:00.480
Is that so?

373
24:01.079 --> 24:02.160
No wonder you're so thin.

374
24:04.079 --> 24:04.799
Well, you're young.

375
24:04.960 --> 24:06.319
Nothing wrong with roughing it a bit now.

376
24:07.839 --> 24:08.759
It gains you some experience.

377
24:09.079 --> 24:10.200
Makes everything easier down the road.

378
24:15.640 --> 24:16.839
Are you a Lacheng local?

379
24:17.799 --> 24:18.440
More or less.

380
24:19.839 --> 24:22.079
Then your parents are old-timers at Lapi Brewery?

381
24:24.319 --> 24:25.240
They used to be.

382
24:28.359 --> 24:29.200
How old are they?

383
24:31.839 --> 24:32.680
About your age.

384
24:34.240 --> 24:35.079
How old am I?

385
24:37.319 --> 24:38.079
In your fifties.

386
24:45.799 --> 24:46.799
You guessed too high.

387
24:47.079 --> 24:47.519
No.

388
24:49.720 --> 24:50.119
I'm

389
24:50.440 --> 24:51.240
only 52.

390
24:55.279 --> 24:57.559
Are your parents still at Lapi Brewery?

391
24:59.799 --> 25:00.759
Right now...

392
25:05.480 --> 25:06.920
Right now...

393
25:07.559 --> 25:09.400
our telecom store

394
25:10.319 --> 25:11.279
has a new promo.

395
25:12.720 --> 25:13.240
Broadband,

396
25:13.519 --> 25:14.240
300 megs.

397
25:14.640 --> 25:15.400
Crazy fast.

398
25:16.119 --> 25:17.559
Whether you're grinding games

399
25:17.599 --> 25:18.359
or watching videos,

400
25:18.839 --> 25:20.319
the speed is rock-solid.

401
25:20.839 --> 25:22.000
Why not check it out?

402
25:24.000 --> 25:25.240
I just had it installed a few days ago.

403
25:25.720 --> 25:26.920
If I'd met you earlier,

404
25:26.920 --> 25:28.000
I would've gone with yours.

405
25:30.000 --> 25:32.200
It's fine if you just got it.

406
25:32.519 --> 25:33.880
If you have friends or family,

407
25:34.000 --> 25:34.559
just have them contact me.

408
25:34.680 --> 25:36.000
My name and number

409
25:36.079 --> 25:36.559
are right here.

410
25:37.200 --> 25:38.720
I'll set everything up for them.

411
25:42.960 --> 25:43.599
Liu Xiaosheng.

412
25:43.680 --> 25:44.000
Right?

413
25:45.039 --> 25:46.200
You can just call me Xiao Liu.

414
25:50.519 --> 25:52.000
You're clearly a good kid.

415
25:57.480 --> 25:57.920
Server!

416
26:04.680 --> 26:05.000
Bro...

417
26:05.240 --> 26:05.920
Come on.

418
26:05.960 --> 26:07.519
I'm about your parents' age.

419
26:07.559 --> 26:08.319
Treating you to a meal is nothing.

420
26:08.400 --> 26:09.440
Besides, you helped me up earlier.

421
26:09.480 --> 26:10.119
I feel bad about this.

422
26:10.160 --> 26:10.599
Don't worry about it.

423
26:10.640 --> 26:11.480
Nothing to feel bad about. Tell you what,

424
26:11.839 --> 26:12.920
if you need anything later on,

425
26:12.960 --> 26:13.799
come find me at the store.

426
26:14.000 --> 26:14.599
I'll give you a discount.

427
26:14.839 --> 26:15.279
Sounds good.

428
26:15.319 --> 26:15.680
Great.

429
26:18.240 --> 26:18.680
Great.

430
26:19.200 --> 26:20.160
Thanks, bro.

431
26:20.559 --> 26:21.160
Why call me "bro"?

432
26:21.200 --> 26:21.920
Call me Uncle.

433
26:22.319 --> 26:23.960
I'm about your dad's age.

434
26:24.160 --> 26:24.680
Call me Uncle.

435
26:26.200 --> 26:27.400
Thanks, Uncle.

436
26:28.000 --> 26:28.279
That's it.

437
26:35.559 --> 26:36.119
Here,

438
26:37.200 --> 26:38.000
my number.

439
26:38.640 --> 26:39.519
If anything comes up,

440
26:39.799 --> 26:40.400
feel free to call me.

441
26:41.000 --> 26:41.640
You got it.

442
26:42.000 --> 26:42.799
Not just about work,

443
26:42.920 --> 26:44.079
personal matters too.

444
26:47.680 --> 26:48.079
All right, then.

445
26:48.319 --> 26:49.359
I'll take off now.

446
26:49.680 --> 26:50.160
Should I...

447
26:50.200 --> 26:51.079
No, no, don't get up.

448
26:51.640 --> 26:52.279
Stay and eat.

449
26:52.720 --> 26:53.680
I'm taking this with me.

450
26:53.799 --> 26:54.440
Sure thing.

451
27:45.799 --> 27:46.279
Gao,

452
27:47.359 --> 27:48.000
take

453
27:48.559 --> 27:49.880
the bottle caps found

454
27:49.920 --> 27:51.160
on the three victims,

455
27:51.799 --> 27:52.279
photograph them,

456
27:52.359 --> 27:53.400
and send them all to me.

457
27:54.920 --> 27:55.680
All right, don't worry about it.

458
27:56.119 --> 27:56.559
I have a use for them.

459
28:17.480 --> 28:18.039
Bro.

460
28:19.319 --> 28:19.960
Bro, it's Xiao Guo.

461
28:20.000 --> 28:20.359
I was just...

462
28:20.400 --> 28:21.200
I-I won't run anymore.

463
28:21.240 --> 28:21.599
Okay?

464
28:21.599 --> 28:22.119
Wait...

465
28:22.720 --> 28:23.319
So you're here.

466
28:23.319 --> 28:24.359
I was just heading down to meet you.

467
28:24.559 --> 28:25.440
Where did you go again?

468
28:25.720 --> 28:26.319
I went down to look for...

469
28:27.119 --> 28:27.440
my notebook.

470
28:27.799 --> 28:28.160
All right.

471
28:29.319 --> 28:29.680
Bro,

472
28:30.160 --> 28:32.559
you asked me for those three bottle caps today.

473
28:32.640 --> 28:33.759
Did you find something?

474
28:34.240 --> 28:34.839
Yeah.

475
28:35.400 --> 28:36.240
What did you find?

476
28:36.319 --> 28:37.000
I...

477
28:37.400 --> 28:38.079
I found out that...

478
28:38.920 --> 28:39.640
you're pretty sharp.

479
28:40.880 --> 28:42.240
Bro, stop messing around.

480
28:43.400 --> 28:44.200
Here, take a look.

481
28:44.480 --> 28:45.720
These are the three bottle caps you sent me.

482
28:46.599 --> 28:47.160
Look.

483
28:47.640 --> 28:48.599
Notice anything different?

484
28:49.480 --> 28:50.279
The designs are different.

485
28:50.319 --> 28:51.519
I noticed that when I sent them.

486
28:54.000 --> 28:54.839
Take another look at this.

487
29:02.880 --> 29:04.400
You mean not only is the style different,

488
29:05.160 --> 29:07.039
but the bottle cap in Cao Jun's case

489
29:07.359 --> 29:07.920
was pried open before

490
29:08.279 --> 29:08.880
and used?

491
29:09.720 --> 29:11.279
That's why you're the smart one.

492
29:12.519 --> 29:14.039
Ma Guowen had dozens of

493
29:14.039 --> 29:16.000
commemorative bottle caps framed on his wall,

494
29:16.240 --> 29:17.599
but none were found at the scene.

495
29:18.039 --> 29:20.039
The killer most likely took them.

496
29:20.279 --> 29:21.960
If the killer had those commemorative caps,

497
29:21.960 --> 29:22.680
he should've used one of those

498
29:22.680 --> 29:23.680
instead of suddenly switching styles

499
29:23.960 --> 29:24.720
and ruining the ritual.

500
29:24.880 --> 29:25.400
Exactly.

501
29:27.279 --> 29:28.400
So we've been

502
29:28.400 --> 29:30.039
heading down the wrong path this whole time.

503
29:30.039 --> 29:31.440
There's more than one killer.

504
29:34.480 --> 29:35.880
But we screened everyone we had to.

505
29:36.200 --> 29:36.960
Everyone from the brewery,

506
29:37.680 --> 29:39.319
especially those involved in the auction back then.

507
29:40.000 --> 29:40.759
None of them turned out

508
29:40.759 --> 29:42.200
to have that commemorative cap.

509
29:42.599 --> 29:43.680
Come on, do you really think

510
29:43.680 --> 29:45.599
if the killer wanted to use it in the crime,

511
29:45.599 --> 29:46.880
he'd let you find it that easily?

512
29:49.000 --> 29:49.920
In Cao Jun's case,

513
29:50.440 --> 29:52.279
our primary suspects

514
29:52.279 --> 29:53.799
all have alibis.

515
29:54.279 --> 29:56.000
But if what we just deduced holds,

516
29:57.079 --> 29:59.079
that Cao Jun's killer and Ma Guowen's killer

517
29:59.079 --> 29:59.839
aren't the same person,

518
30:01.160 --> 30:02.039
then all the leads

519
30:02.319 --> 30:03.759
we investigated have to be thrown out.

520
30:10.640 --> 30:11.759
There's definitely more than one killer.

521
30:16.559 --> 30:17.279
Cao Jun...

522
30:18.519 --> 30:19.920
The traitor mentioned in the diary

523
30:21.519 --> 30:22.400
is Chen Qingchun.

524
30:25.440 --> 30:27.000
His son Chen Yuan stole the tape.

525
30:27.839 --> 30:29.000
He claimed he did it for Liu Xuemei,

526
30:29.640 --> 30:30.519
but when he returned it,

527
30:30.519 --> 30:32.279
half of the tape had been erased.

528
30:32.440 --> 30:34.079
That footage was about Chen Qingchun.

529
30:34.799 --> 30:36.359
Back during the brewery's auction,

530
30:36.359 --> 30:37.599
everyone was locked inside the plant.

531
30:37.720 --> 30:38.000
Right.

532
30:38.000 --> 30:40.480
The security guard gave the key to Chen Qingchun.

533
30:40.599 --> 30:42.480
Chen Yuan didn't do it by accident at all.

534
30:42.519 --> 30:43.799
He was covering for his dad.

535
30:45.880 --> 30:47.200
So Cao Jun

536
30:47.240 --> 30:48.359
was silenced.

537
30:48.680 --> 30:50.279
Cao Jun knew the traitor was Chen Qingchun.

538
30:50.400 --> 30:51.680
He must've blackmailed him.

539
30:51.799 --> 30:53.200
Chen Qingchun panicked and wanted him dead,

540
30:53.680 --> 30:54.920
so he copied the earlier case.

541
30:55.039 --> 30:55.720
The beer bottle cap,

542
30:55.720 --> 30:56.119
the plastic bag,

543
30:56.119 --> 30:56.839
every single detail was there.

544
30:56.920 --> 30:58.920
His goal was to pin Cao Jun's death

545
30:59.000 --> 31:00.799
on the killer in Ma Guowen's case.

546
31:01.000 --> 31:01.480
Am I right?

547
31:01.519 --> 31:03.400
So Chen Qingchun killed Cao Jun.

548
31:03.680 --> 31:04.279
Exactly.

549
31:04.799 --> 31:05.720
The logic tracks, right?

550
31:06.039 --> 31:06.480
Right.

551
31:07.440 --> 31:07.960
Right.

552
31:09.720 --> 31:10.319
Wait, no.

553
31:10.799 --> 31:12.400
Chen Qingchun has an alibi.

554
31:12.799 --> 31:13.839
The night Cao Jun died,

555
31:14.000 --> 31:15.279
he crashed into the sculpture at the plant.

556
31:15.559 --> 31:16.119
He wasn't at the scene.

557
31:16.160 --> 31:16.839
Right?

558
31:21.720 --> 31:22.160
Wait, didn't you

559
31:22.200 --> 31:22.920
just say earlier

560
31:22.920 --> 31:24.519
that we're throwing out all previous theories?

561
31:25.799 --> 31:26.440
Did I say that?

562
31:27.480 --> 31:28.000
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

563
31:28.039 --> 31:28.720
I said that.

564
31:28.799 --> 31:29.400
Right.

565
31:30.559 --> 31:31.000
Right.

566
31:31.759 --> 31:32.759
You did say it.

567
32:00.400 --> 32:00.799
Dad...

568
32:02.480 --> 32:04.519
Just how many terrible things did you do?

569
32:05.519 --> 32:07.559
The traitor they've been looking for all this time,

570
32:08.480 --> 32:10.720
the one who sold out the workers back then...

571
32:12.160 --> 32:12.920
was you.

572
32:24.559 --> 32:26.079
From Shen Leshui's tape,

573
32:26.640 --> 32:27.640
everything about you,

574
32:28.880 --> 32:29.920
I wiped it all clean.

575
32:32.200 --> 32:33.400
No one will ever know.

576
33:10.039 --> 33:10.680
So

577
33:14.079 --> 33:15.279
what did the police say?

578
33:18.480 --> 33:19.519
I just said

579
33:20.039 --> 33:21.680
I wiped it by accident,

580
33:23.480 --> 33:25.640
and that I had no idea what was on it.

581
33:44.279 --> 33:45.599
Back then,

582
33:46.799 --> 33:48.799
Ma Guowen forced me into it, too.

583
33:58.599 --> 34:00.359
No one will ever find out now.

584
34:02.160 --> 34:03.599
Just put your mind at ease.

585
34:23.320 --> 34:24.559
The way I see it,

586
34:25.000 --> 34:26.880
after tomorrow's auction,

587
34:27.119 --> 34:28.519
we'll become Lapi Brewery's

588
34:28.599 --> 34:30.159
true partners!

589
34:30.320 --> 34:31.639
Great!

590
34:32.159 --> 34:33.880
Let's all pull together

591
34:34.280 --> 34:35.960
and make Lapi Brewery thrive.

592
34:36.199 --> 34:37.400
You bet! Great!

593
34:37.559 --> 34:39.320
And as for the technical side,

594
34:39.679 --> 34:41.400
I'll make sure our quality stays top-notch.

595
34:42.440 --> 34:42.880
Come on,

596
34:43.000 --> 34:45.840
let's welcome the new millennium together

597
34:46.039 --> 34:48.599
and usher in a new spring for Lapi Brewery!

598
35:38.119 --> 35:39.719
What show do you want to watch?

599
35:40.000 --> 35:41.400
The TV's messed up,

600
35:41.920 --> 35:43.280
and your eyes are going bad.

601
35:44.599 --> 35:45.679
Take your father-in-law.

602
35:47.000 --> 35:48.480
Nobody puts on a show like him.

603
35:55.760 --> 35:56.719
You, too.

604
35:57.280 --> 35:58.599
Why do you keep running over here?

605
35:59.840 --> 36:01.360
I came to cook for you.

606
36:02.079 --> 36:03.159
Is checking on you a crime now?

607
36:03.719 --> 36:04.440
I'm not hungry.

608
36:06.320 --> 36:07.639
Just seeing Chen Qingchun

609
36:07.880 --> 36:08.880
makes my blood boil.

610
36:16.559 --> 36:18.760
He said he wants to transfer you and Chen Yuan away.

611
36:18.760 --> 36:19.440
What's that all about?

612
36:21.519 --> 36:22.719
The way I see it, that man...

613
36:22.719 --> 36:24.400
is really regressing with age.

614
36:25.079 --> 36:26.440
Always doing things on a whim.

615
36:27.599 --> 36:28.199
In the past,

616
36:28.199 --> 36:29.599
at least he had a clear head.

617
36:29.840 --> 36:30.360
And now?

618
36:30.360 --> 36:31.159
He's gotten older,

619
36:31.320 --> 36:32.440
and more muddled by the day.

620
36:32.760 --> 36:34.280
He even tried to fob me off with cheap tea dust.

621
36:34.280 --> 36:34.760
Can you believe that?

622
36:35.480 --> 36:37.519
He's an engineer, an intellectual, after all.

623
36:37.599 --> 36:38.679
Look at the way he handles things.

624
36:40.519 --> 36:41.440
Come on, that's enough.

625
36:42.519 --> 36:43.880
Chen Yuan's dad must feel

626
36:44.480 --> 36:45.760
that with his son having a criminal record,

627
36:45.800 --> 36:47.039
it's hard for him to stay here.

628
36:48.960 --> 36:50.559
He thinks transferring us all away,

629
36:51.119 --> 36:51.880
getting out of here,

630
36:52.679 --> 36:54.920
will wipe the slate clean with the past.

631
36:56.119 --> 36:57.360
What era does he think this is?

632
37:00.719 --> 37:01.760
What are you shouting about?

633
37:02.280 --> 37:03.559
Trying to show off how smart you are?

634
37:04.280 --> 37:05.000
Who are you talking to?

635
37:05.800 --> 37:06.960
I wasn't talking to you!

636
37:07.880 --> 37:08.679
All right, all right.

637
37:08.800 --> 37:09.400
Xiaoqin,

638
37:09.719 --> 37:10.719
stop cooking.

639
37:11.039 --> 37:12.360
You're filling the whole house with greasy smoke.

640
37:12.360 --> 37:13.360
Just hurry up and go home, go on.

641
37:13.800 --> 37:14.800
It's driving me crazy.

642
37:15.599 --> 37:16.480
Dad,

643
37:17.320 --> 37:18.719
what's gotten into you today?

644
37:18.960 --> 37:19.880
Let me tell you.

645
37:20.360 --> 37:20.920
If he wants to leave,

646
37:20.960 --> 37:21.760
let him leave.

647
37:21.840 --> 37:22.920
I'm not going anywhere.

648
37:23.760 --> 37:25.159
I've lived in Lacheng my entire life.

649
37:25.519 --> 37:26.039
When I die,

650
37:26.239 --> 37:27.440
I'm dying right here.

651
37:27.800 --> 37:29.559
Nobody said they were leaving!

652
37:31.159 --> 37:33.119
You're getting senile yourself.

653
37:37.880 --> 37:38.400
Ali.

654
37:39.599 --> 37:40.199
Sit down.

655
37:42.840 --> 37:44.039
Getting senile, am I?

656
37:45.880 --> 37:46.480
Sit down.

657
37:47.199 --> 37:48.599
I told you to sit down, did you hear me?

658
37:48.920 --> 37:50.119
Every single one of you...

659
37:51.440 --> 37:52.920
none of you gives me any peace!

660
37:55.280 --> 37:56.119
Dinner's ready.

661
37:56.559 --> 37:57.119
I'm not eating.

662
37:58.800 --> 37:59.880
I'm full enough on anger alone.

663
38:07.480 --> 38:07.920
Self-draw!

664
38:09.079 --> 38:09.480
Old Chen,

665
38:09.480 --> 38:10.679
you're really lucky today!

666
38:10.679 --> 38:11.280
Winning every single hand!

667
38:11.280 --> 38:13.679
A win off the kong, too!

668
38:13.760 --> 38:14.159
That's the max payout!

669
38:14.159 --> 38:14.639
You're raking it in every round!

670
38:14.639 --> 38:15.480
Come on, pay up!

671
38:15.880 --> 38:17.119
Drawing the bonus tile every time!

672
38:18.039 --> 38:19.159
Who ordered soda?

673
38:19.719 --> 38:20.480
Soda's here!

674
38:20.840 --> 38:21.280
Put it here.

675
38:22.639 --> 38:23.480
Listen up, everyone!

676
38:23.480 --> 38:25.440
The sodas are on me today!

677
38:27.039 --> 38:28.119
Great, great!

678
38:28.239 --> 38:28.800
How much?

679
38:28.800 --> 38:29.360
Fifty-one.

680
38:29.400 --> 38:30.360
Just give me 50.

681
38:30.760 --> 38:31.599
Fifty, huh?

682
38:32.519 --> 38:33.039
Here.

683
38:35.159 --> 38:36.000
It's so filthy!

684
38:36.039 --> 38:36.840
Got a cleaner bill?

685
38:37.559 --> 38:39.400
Old or new, it spends the same, doesn't it?

686
38:39.880 --> 38:41.079
Fine, fine. This old man...

687
38:45.719 --> 38:46.360
Counterfeit!

688
38:46.400 --> 38:47.119
It's fake, isn't it?

689
38:47.119 --> 38:48.159
You gave me fake money!

690
38:48.599 --> 38:49.360
What fake money?!

691
38:49.840 --> 38:51.159
You're claiming I gave you fake money?!

692
38:51.360 --> 38:52.119
What else is it, then?!

693
38:52.159 --> 38:52.880
Take a look, everyone!

694
38:52.920 --> 38:53.639
Is this fake or what?!

695
38:53.679 --> 38:54.239
Shunzi!

696
38:54.440 --> 38:55.320
Show some respect!

697
38:55.559 --> 38:56.119
This is Chief Engineer Chen!

698
38:56.119 --> 38:56.920
Don't you know him?

699
38:57.079 --> 38:58.320
He used to be Chief Engineer.

700
38:58.360 --> 38:59.039
I'm laid off now!

701
38:59.039 --> 38:59.800
I don't care who he is!

702
39:00.679 --> 39:02.159
What nonsense are you spewing?!

703
39:02.400 --> 39:04.000
When have I ever spent fake money?!

704
39:04.480 --> 39:05.400
Trying to destroy the evidence?!

705
39:05.440 --> 39:06.079
Give it back! Back off!

706
39:06.079 --> 39:06.559
Stay away from me!

707
39:06.559 --> 39:08.039
You're picking a fight on purpose, aren't you?

708
39:08.119 --> 39:08.840
Don't put your hands on me!

709
39:08.840 --> 39:09.280
I'm warning you!

710
39:09.320 --> 39:10.159
I'll hit you!

711
39:10.159 --> 39:10.880
Go ahead, hit me! Hit me!

712
39:10.880 --> 39:11.400
I'll smack you!

713
39:11.480 --> 39:12.199
Take that!

714
39:14.239 --> 39:14.960
This punk...

715
39:15.119 --> 39:17.199
Chief Engineer is hitting him! Break it up!

716
39:17.199 --> 39:17.960
I saw the whole thing!

717
39:17.960 --> 39:18.840
Let me tell you,

718
39:19.000 --> 39:19.760
I've got connections!

719
39:19.960 --> 39:21.119
I'm calling the police!

720
39:21.400 --> 39:22.119
- I'm calling the police! - Go on, call them!

721
39:22.199 --> 39:23.199
Call them! Go ahead!

722
39:23.760 --> 39:25.440
Hello, Officer?

723
39:25.920 --> 39:27.599
It's Shunzi!

724
39:27.719 --> 39:29.519
Chen Qingchun beat me up!

725
39:31.360 --> 39:32.559
Keep talking! Go on!

726
39:33.119 --> 39:34.360
Weren't you calling the cops?

727
39:34.679 --> 39:36.519
Saying I spent counterfeit money!

728
39:37.760 --> 39:38.719
Tell the police!

729
39:38.800 --> 39:40.199
Tell them I print counterfeit bills!

730
39:44.119 --> 39:44.599
Look at you.

731
39:44.800 --> 39:45.920
I'm telling you, this spot is clean.

732
39:46.119 --> 39:46.960
Lie on the ground!

733
39:47.599 --> 39:48.840
Lie down and throw a tantrum!

734
39:50.679 --> 39:51.920
Why aren't you throwing a fit now?

735
39:54.400 --> 39:55.400
I barely did anything to him.

736
39:55.400 --> 39:56.519
I just tapped him lightly,

737
39:56.519 --> 39:59.079
and he threw himself down to play victim and call the cops!

738
40:00.280 --> 40:01.119
Unbelievable.

739
40:06.840 --> 40:07.800
Chief Engineer Chen!

740
40:08.239 --> 40:09.280
What are you doing here?

741
40:10.639 --> 40:11.960
What a coincidence. What happened?

742
40:15.039 --> 40:15.960
Yeah, yeah.

743
40:20.639 --> 40:21.440
Just a small misunderstanding.

744
40:24.239 --> 40:24.840
Everything's fine, right?

745
40:24.920 --> 40:25.440
It's fine.

746
40:26.280 --> 40:28.519
All right, since we ran into each other,

747
40:28.760 --> 40:29.519
let's find a room and chat.

748
40:30.880 --> 40:32.639
Mind if I borrow this guy for a bit?

749
40:32.840 --> 40:34.239
I'll explain everything to you later.

750
40:34.400 --> 40:34.800
Sure thing.

751
40:36.480 --> 40:37.000
Let's go.

752
40:53.000 --> 40:53.800
Wait here a moment.

753
40:57.239 --> 40:58.079
Over here. This way.

754
40:58.199 --> 40:59.000
This way, Chief Engineer Chen.

755
40:59.360 --> 40:59.719
Please.

756
41:01.000 --> 41:01.679
It's all right.

757
41:01.800 --> 41:02.480
It's no big deal.

758
41:02.559 --> 41:03.880
They'll sort it out right away.

759
41:05.039 --> 41:05.800
Have a seat, sit down.

760
41:06.360 --> 41:07.000
It's warm inside.

761
41:07.000 --> 41:08.079
Take off your coat.

762
41:08.960 --> 41:09.480
Sure.

763
41:10.719 --> 41:11.880
No offense, but... Thanks.

764
41:12.280 --> 41:13.280
At your age,

765
41:13.280 --> 41:14.840
why get so worked up over a kid?

766
41:18.239 --> 41:19.800
He said the money I gave him

767
41:21.039 --> 41:21.840
was counterfeit.

768
41:22.480 --> 41:24.639
I mean, at my age,

769
41:25.679 --> 41:27.760
I'm an intellectual after all,

770
41:28.039 --> 41:29.400
honest and upright.

771
41:30.119 --> 41:32.079
Why would I ever use counterfeit money?

772
41:32.199 --> 41:32.719
I understand, of course.

773
41:32.760 --> 41:34.000
He definitely misunderstood you.

774
41:36.039 --> 41:37.039
Actually, the reason I came to see you today

775
41:37.079 --> 41:38.239
is mainly to ask about something.

776
41:38.719 --> 41:40.599
Your son, Chen Yuan,

777
41:40.960 --> 41:41.960
stole someone's tapes.

778
41:42.000 --> 41:42.639
Did you know about that?

779
41:43.800 --> 41:44.199
I...

780
41:47.840 --> 41:48.599
I didn't know.

781
41:49.079 --> 41:49.519
I have no idea.

782
41:50.679 --> 41:52.440
He broke into Shen Leshui's place

783
41:53.119 --> 41:54.559
and took the footage she shot of you

784
41:54.559 --> 41:56.800
and the other veteran workers for that documentary—

785
41:57.119 --> 41:58.960
all that discarded footage, he stole it.

786
41:59.280 --> 42:00.360
And after stealing it,

787
42:00.360 --> 42:02.000
he erased a lot of the content.

788
42:02.840 --> 42:03.559
What content?

789
42:04.719 --> 42:05.400
Funny thing is,

790
42:05.920 --> 42:07.840
when we verified it later,

791
42:07.880 --> 42:09.119
the parts he erased

792
42:09.239 --> 42:10.199
all had to do with you.

793
42:11.199 --> 42:11.760
Me?

794
42:13.920 --> 42:15.800
On the last day of 1999,

795
42:16.679 --> 42:18.639
Ma Guowen used an excuse

796
42:18.639 --> 42:19.760
about a burglary at the brewery, right?

797
42:19.840 --> 42:20.840
The truth is, it was just

798
42:20.840 --> 42:22.360
to keep the workers trapped inside,

799
42:22.360 --> 42:23.599
so they couldn't attend the auction.

800
42:23.760 --> 42:24.599
You knew about that.

801
42:25.199 --> 42:25.639
I did.

802
42:26.280 --> 42:27.920
Then why did you disappear that day?

803
42:28.719 --> 42:29.239
I...

804
42:30.159 --> 42:31.119
I was at the brewery!

805
42:31.360 --> 42:33.119
I was right there with everyone!

806
42:33.960 --> 42:35.280
Except that...

807
42:35.679 --> 42:38.159
I stepped away once to use the restroom.

808
42:39.440 --> 42:40.800
That was the only time I was gone.

809
42:40.800 --> 42:42.239
So they couldn't film you while you were away,

810
42:42.519 --> 42:43.039
right?

811
42:44.239 --> 42:45.239
Well, look at Chief Engineer Chen.

812
42:45.599 --> 42:46.639
What a memory!

813
42:46.840 --> 42:47.880
Back in '99,

814
42:48.400 --> 42:50.159
and he still remembers a bathroom break.

815
42:50.519 --> 42:51.679
Write that down, note it down.

816
42:55.599 --> 42:56.039
Engineer Chen.

817
42:57.360 --> 42:58.599
You were the traitor back then, weren't you?

818
43:00.239 --> 43:01.199
You're the traitor!

819
43:01.480 --> 43:02.440
Go ask around!

820
43:03.360 --> 43:05.639
I was the brewery's Chief Engineer,

821
43:05.960 --> 43:06.960
a model worker!

822
43:07.039 --> 43:08.000
You can check for yourself!

823
43:08.599 --> 43:09.719
Where were you the day Cao Jun died?

824
43:10.039 --> 43:10.679
Cao Jun?

825
43:16.480 --> 43:17.639
I was at my son's place.

826
43:19.760 --> 43:20.840
I had a few drinks,

827
43:21.079 --> 43:22.079
took a nap,

828
43:22.960 --> 43:24.599
and drove home later.

829
43:25.719 --> 43:27.599
But as I passed the brewery gate,

830
43:28.960 --> 43:30.039
I crashed into that sculpture.

831
43:31.199 --> 43:32.760
Then... then I went to

832
43:34.159 --> 43:34.840
the traffic police.

833
43:35.199 --> 43:35.920
It was all settled.

834
43:36.159 --> 43:36.519
Right.

835
43:37.840 --> 43:39.719
I still... I still have the ticket right here.

836
43:41.000 --> 43:41.719
Take a look yourself.

837
43:56.199 --> 43:57.880
You remember taking a piss back in '99,

838
43:57.880 --> 43:59.199
but forgot how the car crash happened?

839
44:01.239 --> 44:02.960
I found a piece of car debris.

840
44:04.119 --> 44:05.559
But this is silver.

841
44:06.159 --> 44:07.880
Chen Qingchun's car was black, wasn't it?

842
44:08.400 --> 44:09.639
Why did you go

843
44:10.480 --> 44:12.440
to the traffic police to take the fall for me?

844
44:12.679 --> 44:14.000
Don't think I don't know

845
44:16.880 --> 44:18.079
what you did.
